  (text "J16: ADC/DAC sub-board (adc_hat/, Pi Zero pHAT outline). SPI0 = 19/21/23, CE0 24 = CS_ADC, CE1 26 = CS_DAC,\nGPIO4 (7, GPCLK0) = HAT_CLK from Pico GP21 via R47, GPIO24 (18) = ADC_SYNC, GPIO25 (22) = ADC_DRDY.\nJ17: analog link to the sub-board; signals on the even pins, GND on the odd pins (ADCn N tied to GND here)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 129.54 525.78 0)
    (effects
